# Dancing from Dark to Dawn: "Whenever you cast a creature spell, put X +1/+1 counters on target creature you control, where X is
# that spell's mana value. Landfall - Whenever a land you control enters, create a 2/2 green Bear creature token." On turn 1 Bot1
# casts it for {3}{G}{G} and plays a Forest: a green 2/2 Bear. Bot2's own Grizzly Bears (mana value 2) and Ornithopter on turn 2 and Island trigger nothing. On
# turn 3 Walking Ballista is cast with X of 1, a spell of mana value 2 on the stack (CR 202.3e): the Ornithopter (the opponent's is
# no target) gets exactly two +1/+1 counters; then a Plains makes a second Bear.

